# Admin platform (confirmed)

Two dashboards: **Nivra admin** (`/admin`) and **Company admin** (`/company`). Auth provider TBD (Better Auth vs Clerk — Sasmith). Use dummy data until auth/DB land. Tiers TBD (Sasmith).

## Product rules

- **Tenancy:** shared app `nivra.app`; company branding after login. No custom subdomain/domain at launch. One org per user. Advisors only — no client logins.
- **Nivra admin roles:** Main admin · Support staff (advisor generating reports). Nivra logo on chrome. Sees all companies (active / inactive / suspended / trial), users, logos, reports count, subscription tier.
- **Company admin roles:** Admin (Owner) · Advisor · Viewer. Subscriber is initial Owner. Seat limits from plan. Owner manages users. Sees plan, seats used/left, renewal/status. Calculator access by plan. Branding editables (Admin/Advisor): disclaimer, logos, company name, phone, email. Usage read-only: reports this month, active advisors. Default theme.
- **Lock:** soft-lock expired/suspended for a few days (view-only), then hard lock.
- **Branding:** Nivra logo on app chrome; company branding on PDF reports. **"Powered by Nivra"** on every footer + report.

## Tech stack

| Concern | Choice | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Hosting | Vercel | Free → Pro ~$20/mo |
| DB | Neon | Free 0.5 GB → usage paid |
| Email | Brevo | Free ~300/day → Starter ₹562.50 / 5k |
| Images | ImageKit | Free 20 GB bw / 3 GB storage |
| Auth | TBD | Better Auth (self) vs Clerk (hosted, branding) |
| Logs | Better Stack | Free 3 GB / 3 days |

Do not invent auth/billing APIs yet. Keep admin UI on shadcn shell tokens; reuse calculator kit only for calc pages.
